WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.900
New to this? You do not know what you have not thought about.

2
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:14.900
Eight things get checked. Competitors are one of them.

3
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:20.900
The other seven are about your idea, not their companies.

4
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:28.900
Two are marked with a question mark.

5
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:36.100
Those we do not answer. A small model guessing at strategy would be worse than useless.

6
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:42.100
So it raises the questions instead.

7
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:50.100
This one needs farms and restaurants before it works for either.

8
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:56.700
Which side you get first is the decision that sinks most two-sided businesses.

9
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:02.800
It says what made it think so, and links it.

10
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:10.200
The questions come from a book we did not summarise. Read it.

11
00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:15.700
These are month-six questions, now. Checking any of it is next.
